Z||000000||BBBAD GT||08-28-2000||09:37 AM||||I borrowed a Sony digital cameral over the weekend, and took some short mpeg's of BBBAD V8 accelerating and such.  They range from 183k-287k.  You can hear what a V8 would sound like with a late model Fbody Flowmaster muffler accerating from different gears.  My neighbor was taking the shots, so don't blame me for the camera angles   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  <P>Anyway, I've uploaded them all to:<BR> <A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero/" TARGET=_blank>http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero/</A> <P>There are other pics there also, most of them you all have seen, but I'm in the progress of making a webpage for all of this (might take a while, I know almost nothing about web pages).  <P>Enjoy   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>BTW, if you want more, I have another Incar Video of a 11.13 @ 127 w/1.50 60' run with the Mustang at Gateway Dragstrip at:<BR> <A HREF="http://home.att.net/~nomercy5.0/Quartermile.asf" TARGET=_blank>http://home.att.net/~nomercy5.0/Quartermile.asf</A> <P><BR>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/BBBAD_GT_SIG.gif">     <P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/V8Fiero" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD V8</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/Fiero.htm" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD GT</A><P><A HREF="http://scribers.midwest.net/bbbad50/" TARGET=_blank>BBBAD 5.0</A><p>[This message has been edited by BBBAD GT (edited 08-28-2000).]||||reg||6
